h battery pack gets 500 full power flashes with 0 01 to 2 1 sec recycling easily readable digital panel displays your adjustments barn boors color filters and diffusers are available to personalize your work 8 step power range 1 1 to 1 128 supports flash exposure compensation 1 8000 sec high speed sync first and second curtain sync modeling lamp manual flash multi flash and custom functions
