__label__bookseurope for a bargain europe for a bargain is a short light travel humor book chronicling an average middle class indian s observation of places and people on a trip across the first world don t read this book if you solely want ideas on best places to travel in europe the internet has sufficient material on that read it if you want to understand what middle class indians perceive and consider worth seeing in the first world this book opens a window to a world very different than what we indians live in and in the process gives us a glimpse of ourselves warning leave your sensitivity aside before you start reading
