 the cutting intelligence of the god delusion james d watson co discoverer of dna author of the double helix 				 	 					 		 		 	 	 		about the author richard dawkins taught zoology at the university of california at berkeley and at oxford university and is now the charles simonyi professor of the public understanding of science at oxford a position he has held since 1995 among his previous books are the ancestor s tale the selfish gene the blind watchmaker climbing mount improbable unweaving the rainbow and a devil s chaplain dawkins lives in oxford with his wife the actress and artist lalla ward
